## A question

::bg{location="hearth" time="dawn"}
@maud{code="0010" emotion="stricken"}: If you get out for good — would you take the kettle? It's never been anywhere.
@wren{code="0010"}: I'd take you.
@maud{code="0020" emotion="wry"}: Don't be daft. Take the kettle.
::set{user.bond.maud += 1}
